  "text": "Christopher Dolan | Austin Veterinary Emergency & Specialty (AVES)\nSkip to Primary Content\nContact Us\nContact Us\nMap\n7501 North Capital of Texas Highway,\nBuilding A,\nAustin,\nTX,\n78731\nCall\n(512) 343-2837\nEmergency\nEmergency\nPhone:\n(512) 343-2837\nAddress:\n7501 North Capital of Texas Highway,\nBuilding A,\nAustin,\nTX,\n78731\nPay Online\nCareers\nAbout Us\nAbout AVES\nOur Team\nCareers\nAngel Fund\nNews & Blog\nServices\nEmergency\nAnesthesiology\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology & Endoscopy\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nAVES Oncology Group\nSurgery & Orthopedics\nView all Services\nPet Owners\nFAQ\nPrescription Refill Form\nPatient Forms\nPay Online\nFinancing\nReferring Veterinarians\nReferral Portal\nReferral Form\nCase Studies\nContinuing Education\nLunch & Learns\nEmergency\nContact Us\nDVM, DACVIM\nChristopher Dolan\nDVM, DACVIM\nChristopher Dolan\nSpecialty | Oncology\nDr. Dolan received his BS in Biomedical Sciences from Texas A&M University prior to completing his Doctor of Veterinary Medicine degree at Texas A&M University as well (Gig 'Em!). While in veterinary school, Dr. Dolan developed a special interest in veterinary oncology and pursued further training in this field. He completed an internship in small animal medicine and surgery at Georgia Veterinary Specialists in Atlanta, Georgia in 2018. Dr. Dolan continued his training at the Flint Animal Cancer Center at Colorado State University with a speciality internship in veterinary medical oncology which he completed in 2019. He returned to Texas A&M University in 2019 for his medical oncology residency and became board certified in veterinary medical oncology in 2022. Dr. Dolan has special interest in multi-modality therapy and emerging diagnostic techniques, such as liquid biopsy.\nDr. Dolan loves living in Austin with his wife, two dogs, and two cats. When he isn't treating his patients, he enjoys cooking, baking bread, hiking, astronomy, and working out.\nContact Us\nAbout AVES\nView all Services\nPatient Forms\nReferral Portal\nContact Us\nPhone:\n(512) 343-2837\nFax:\n(512) 343-2844\nAddress:\n7501 North Capital of Texas Highway\nBuilding A\nAustin\n,\nTX\n78731\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nOpen 24/7/365 for Pet Emergencies, Specialty Services Available by Appointment Only.\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nCookie Preferences",
